      "raw": "<p>So a friend has copies of the original 4 promos (YL/HotH/RCWraith/Redeemer) that he doesn&#39;t want. They are, of course, the only ones I don&#39;t yet have, so I&#39;m going to trade for them out of my overflowing boardgame library. The problem is that I have absolutely no idea what price I shold give him when he starts picking things out. There&#39;s a handful of eBay and BGG listings, but a number of them are incomplete/have a bunch of extra stuff/not sold/etc., and I just can&#39;t get an idea of whether they&#39;re actually worth $5 or $500. He&#39;s not attached and isn&#39;t interested in putting them on eBay himself (he had no idea they were anything special and initially offerred them to me for far too little), but I want to give him fair value for a relatively rare commodity.&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Can anyone offer some help or advice? USD preferred, but I&quot;m happy to convert from your local currency if needed.</span></p>",
