      "created_at": "2016-06-08T22:12:28.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Boardgamegeek provides a good history of the sale value of games sold there, so that's a pretty decent way to see how the cards have trended in the past.</p><p>I've seen YL alone go for $100-150, and the other ones usually range somewhere between $20 and $50. But honestly, I'd ask your friend what he's interested in and go from there. If you're both happy with what you get, what does it matter what they're actually worth?</p>",
