    {
      "id": 177453,
      "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
      "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-06-09T01:19:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"dpt\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/48/1922_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> dpt:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Will the going price for these promos drop, with the upcoming release of the variant packs?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Maybe, but probably not much. It’s always been possible to get cheap substitutes, since gtg doesn’t mind home proxies. It’s the collector’s value that makes then valuable, not their game text.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:01:28.705Z",
