      "raw": "[quote=\"bobbertoriley\"]\n\nBoardgamegeek provides a good history of the sale value of games sold there, so that&#39;s a pretty decent way to see how the cards have trended in the past.I&#39;ve seen YL alone go for $100-150, and the other ones usually range somewhere between $20 and $50. But honestly, I&#39;d ask your friend what he&#39;s interested in and go from there. If you&#39;re both happy with what you get, what does it matter what they&#39;re actually worth?\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nFWIW, I agree with these prices ranges from what I recall of scanning ebay over the years, including relatively recently.\n\n&nbsp;\n",
